window.products.push({"id":454005,"name":"Steak Knives Set of 4 Stainless Steel serrated steak knives Natural wood handle Knife Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EtQkk2+0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LANDOSAN is a supplier focused on making high-quality tools that combine traditional craftsmanship with innovative materials to produce high-quality tools. After our designer experienced hundreds of designs, we finally got this knife that is in accordance with the engineering design of people. Blade body: The whole piece of high-quality stainless steel is integrated from the blade tip to the end of the handle to achieve a true blade body. The perfect design and excellent craftsmanship and technical polishing are polished. It has sharp serrated edges, anti-rust, beautiful, durable. Wait for a little bit more, can be used with confidence, to ensure that the use process is safer. Knife handle: ergonomic design to achieve the best hand control, log handle, streamlined design fits the palm, 3 rivets inlaid, hand polished, excellent grip, no slippage, no freezing hands, easy to operate. The wooden handle remains natural and food safe. This steak knife is suitable for dinners, barbecue parties, family gatherings and daily meals. It brings convenience to you and your family. Not only can this be used as a cutlery knife and kitchen knife, you can also use it to cut some fruits and vegetables, hoping to bring you a good experience. It is the perfect gift for your family and friends' wedding, mother's day, birthday, housewarming, thanksgiving. Steak knife sets including 4 steak knife How to care for your knife 1. Before using for the first time, please clean the knife, please avoid direct contact with the blade! 2. When using, please note that the blade of the knife is very sharp! Do not use your fingertips for testing, and avoid direct contact to avoid injury. 3. Be careful when using and storing! After each use, please clean and store in a safe place, away from children! 4. In order to maintain the service life of the knife, it is strongly recommended to wash it by hand and wipe it dry immediately","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EtQkk2+0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANDOSAN","source_asin":"B09YR176DZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YR176DZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YR176DZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
