window.products.push({"id":454035,"name":"Wheat Straw Dinnerware Sets for 4, 48PCS Unbreakable Microwave Dishwasher Safe Dinnerware Set for Adults, Reusable Lightweight Plates Cups and Bowls S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nbuiTBsyL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Value Set includes 4 plates, 4 bowls, 4 cups, 4 fruit plates, 4 cutlery sets and a complimentary set of fruit sticks. They are easy to clean, well textured, durable and stylish looking. Safe ＆ Healthy Materials----This lightweight dinnerware sets is made of durable, high quality and 100% BPA free natural wheat straw and food grade PP. It can be used for many years. If you are planning a camping trip/party with family, friends and neighbors, you can offering this sustainable dishes set instead of disposable plates. This will reduce wasted money and landfill space. Of course. They are pretty and definitely not boring. Lightweight ＆ Unbreakable----No more worries about breaking, chipping, or dropping heavy dishes. Our unbreakable dinnerware set won't shatter like glassware, they're sustainable, and they're sensory-friendly! No more clanking sounds with these. They are ideal for anyone but especially for older adults who may not be able to manipulate heavier dishes. Great For Camper, RV , Travel Trailers----Our unbreakable dishware set is perfect for use in the camper/travel trailer/RV. They stack nicely and don't take up a lot of room. They are thick and durable and won't break while moving in a trailer. This would be a great addition to a travel trailer/ camper/RV ! Microwave, Dishwasher ＆ Freezer Safe----You can put them in the microwave and heat foods up in them. They do not melt around the sides like plastic does. Your food will be safe and plastic-free, which is the most important thing when choosing dishware! They are very easy to clean. Regardless of the meal - think spaghetti sauce - they wash out perfectly in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nbuiTBsyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TurtingAs","source_asin":"B0BBPRT12Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBPRT12Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBPRT12Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
