window.products.push({"id":454343,"name":"Wilton Mad Science Cupcake Decorating Combo Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FBN3TPUNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Cupcake decorating combo packs make it easy to decorate fun cupcakes. The Halloween cupcake combo pack is perfect for your Halloween cupcakes. The 24 baking cups feature eyeballs on an orange foundation, a two-sided beaker with eyeball decorates 12 picks, and an eyeball potion fills a beaker on 12 more. It's simple to make these fun cupcakes - just ice cupcakes as shown and insert the pick. These cupcakes are great for a Halloween party for kids or adults - the gruesome potions theme works for both groups. Coordinating products available. Kit contains 24 baking cups 2 in. (5 cm) dia. And 24 picks. Made in china.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FBN3TPUNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton","source_asin":"B00KKV2RCI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KKV2RCI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KKV2RCI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":454344,"name":"sgofais Nursery/Kid's Bedroom Room Curtains with Foil Print Star Patern, Super Soft Weave Grommet Window Draperies for Girls Bedroom (2 Panels, 52 x63","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fEte+3SOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Having trouble falling asleep as the streetlight streaming in your room? Find it impossible to nap in the day with the strong sunlight on your face? SGOFAIS can help. We specialize in crafting ready-made top-quality blackout curtains so that you can have deep, quiet, and undisturbed sleep. Available in a variety of simple modern colors, SGOFAIS all-season curtains offer more décor possibilities, adding a neat, elegant, and pleasant touch to any settings. Quieter, Absolute Darkness and Privacy Sleep tight with the closed curtains to block out light and noises. Pick darker colors if you prefer a pitch-dark rest zone and lighter colors for your living room and office to better view TVs and movies. Featuring 100% polyester top and back fabric interwoven with high-density black yarn, the SGOFAIS curtains impede up to 85% light, allowing no view-through for absolute privacy. Energy-saving Triple Weave Fabric Thermal-insulated microfiber fabric forms a solid barrier against the summer heat and winter chills, sheltering your room with balanced temperature and cutting back on energy loss. Stay cozy on a smaller energy bill and be happy with a greener footprint. Furthermore, our curtains also protect your furniture, floors and art collections from the damages of the UV rays. Flexible Uses The SGOFAIS curtain set includes 2 panels by 52” wide x 63” (or 84” or 95”) long each, fits windows of 40” to 70” wide if used together. Easy Care The SGOFAIS curtains are machine washable. Just throw in the washing machine and you will have brand new curtains, again. Instructions --Machine washable, wash below 30 °C / 86 ℉ --Gentle cycle, do not bleach, tumble dry low --Warm iron PLEASE NOTE Due to different screen display, the colors of the actual item may vary slightly from the above images.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fEte+3SOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sgofais","source_asin":"B07CTFC9CQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CTFC9CQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CTFC9CQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
