window.products.push({"id":454578,"name":"プチギフト.com Japanese Tea Cups Sushi Yunomi Kaga Yuzen 6.7 fL oz Set of 2 Traditional Japanese Matcha Tea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716uM1LZ4eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This pair of teacups is decorated with a traditional Japanese \"Kaga Yuzen\" pattern. These teacups, called yunomi, are made of ceramic made in Japan. Kaga Yuzen is based on the five colors of rouge, indigo, ocher, grass, and ancient purple, and captures the breath of beautiful nature in the kimono. The patterns are characterized by a picturesque style, centering on calm and realistic floral patterns, and the beauty of the hand-drawn lines can also be felt. It comes in a wooden box, which gives it a very luxurious feel and is perfect as a gift. The surface of the teacup is uneven to make it easy to hold, and it is designed to be non-slip. It is a popular gift for parents, grandparents, and others. Weight: 6.8 oz, Height: 3.7 inches, Diameter: 2.4 inches, Capacity: 6.76 fl oz (200 ml ) Material Porcelain. Microwave and dishwasher-safe. Made in Japan. Compatible tableware (drinks). Green tea, matcha, water, coffee, milk, soup, etc. Details and colors of the images might be different from ones of real products because the position of ware relative to the fire and the way of covering with a glaze might produce unevenness on the patters and shapes. Dishwashable however, it is recommended that you wash your valuable tableware by hand. Washing it in a dishwasher may cause it to crack and break. Putting thin cloth or paper between tableware is recommended when the tableware is stacked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716uM1LZ4eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"プチギフト.com","source_asin":"B0BM8T75VR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM8T75VR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM8T75VR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
