window.products.push({"id":454594,"name":"Bean Products Queen Organic Kapok Pillow + Natural Org Case - 20\" x 30\" - Organic Cotton Zippered Shell - Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":102.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814KyXxwzHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% organic cotton fabric with a luxurious 500 thread count sateen finish - 100% made in USA Our Natural Organic Kapok Pillow is soft like down yet firm enough to not bottom out - providing great head and neck support and unparalled comfort. This exceptional silky lightweight fluffy fiber comes from Rain Forest Kapok trees - Responsibly harvested to maintain an annual supply Protect your health, home and planet with our non-toxic petroleum free natural kapok pillows. Bean Products Pillows, also come in a wide choice of sizes and fills - Cotton and Organic Cotton Fabric are used to make Buckwheat, Millet, and MultiGrain filled pillows","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814KyXxwzHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bean Products","source_asin":"B0C1CVRLBY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1CVRLBY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1CVRLBY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":454595,"name":"Cater Tek 96 Ounce Disposable Coffee Dispensers, 10 Insulated Coffee Take Out Containers - Built-In Handle, LeakResistant Cap, Kraft With Black Paper ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GihobGIaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Make your coffees and hot beverages instantly portable with these handy Restpresso Coffee To Go Take Out Carrier Boxes. Equipped with an insulated interior bag, these cardboard coffee boxes make it effortless for customers to enjoy fresh coffee on the go. The built-in elevated handle provides customers with a convenient way to transport your beverages, while the leak-resistant screw cap prevents annoying spills and messes. With a capacity of 96 ounces, these coffee to go boxes can serve about 12 cups of your freshly brewed coffee. Each of these stylish to go coffee containers features a contemporary coffee bean print, as well as a black accent wall and cursive \"Coffee\" detail. Ideal for coffee shops, bakeries, cafes, restaurants, catering companies, corporate functions, and other foodservice establishments. Each Restpresso Coffee To Go Take Out Carrier Box holds 96 ounces and is shipped in bulk in a 10 count box. Product Specifications Product Material: Paper Product Material: Paper Product Color: Black Product Color: Black Pack Size: 10 count Pack Size: 10 count Product Dimensions: 12.0''L x 7.5''W x 8.5''H Product Dimensions: 12.0''L x 7.5''W x 8.5''H Product Capacity: 96.0 ounces Product Capacity: 96.0 ounces Product SKU: RWA0382B Product SKU: RWA0382B","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GihobGIaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Restaurantware","source_asin":"B093P5CR4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093P5CR4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093P5CR4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":454596,"name":"Southern Enterprises Eldridge Rustic Plank TV Console, Distressed Weathered Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BGyLrpCRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enhance your home with this TV console featuring a wood grain texture in a distressed weathered oak finish and antique bronze hardware. The handsome, cabin character and rustic style of this media console is sure to make a splash in your living space. This unit accommodates a flat panel TV up to 49.5\" W overall for stylish viewing. Closed storage provides the necessary space for games and other amusements while the open media shelves are equipped with convenient cord openings for consoles. The generous storage areas keep items organized and tidy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BGyLrpCRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southern Enterprises","source_asin":"B00NHJGKIC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NHJGKIC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NHJGKIC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":454597,"name":"Friendly Fumes Round Soy Candle Pillar 120-Red-Frankincense and Myrrh 3'' x 6.5'' (Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31nKI3LFHFL._AC_.jpg","description":"Friendly Fumes soy pillar candles are individually hand poured with pure soy wax sourced from American soybean farmers, and real botanical oils. Soy pillar candles stand out from paraffin and other alternatives because soy wax burns cleaner and at a cooler temperature, making for a long-lasting burn that doesn't send a haze of soot and toxic chemicals into the air. Soy pillar candles can sometimes last twice as long as paraffin pillars.We put the same integrity into the wicks as we do in the wax. Our wicks are cored with sturdy hemp, never metal, and braided with U.S. grown, unbleached cotton. The quality of the wick matches the purity of the wax to extend the life of the candle, and diffuse fragrance through your home in a way that's strong, but never overwhelming. Choose your favorite scent from our \"scent library\" of almost 300 fragrances! You'll find florals, sweet citruses, woodsy musks and more. Our richly scented soy pillar candles add a touch of elegance to any room. Choose colors that compliment your décor, or go dye-free and unscented to create a warm, luxurious ambiance with no frills and no fuss. Our soy pillar candles burn clean, tunneling right down the center to avoid unwanted drips and spills. But if you do happen to spill a little hot soy wax, you can clean it up in a pinch with just a little soap and water. It's also easier to get out of carpets and upholstery than petroleum-based waxes. For the highest quality, purest soy pillar candles, you've come to the right place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31nKI3LFHFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Friendly Fumes","source_asin":"B00DUZYY68","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DUZYY68","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DUZYY68","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
