window.products.push({"id":454649,"name":"MRMOSY Digital Meat Thermometer Instant Read Food Thermometer Waterproof Dual Probe with 3 Batteries, Backlight, Built-in Magnet, Temp Alarm for Cooki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dfN4ZXJvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"【Food Grade Dual Probe Design, Easy to Use】This kitchen thermometer has an extra 45\" long wire probe compared to the traditional grill thermometer. The wire is sturdy and allows oven door to close completely, helping you cook the most delicious grilled meat. Unfold the food thermometer and it starts reading immediately, fold the probe to turn it off. If there’s no operation, it’ll auto-switch off after 5 minutes. Can be used in ovens/gril/smokers to know the real-time temperature of meat/bread. 【Ultra Fast and Accurate Reading】The cooking thermometer’s probe head measures only 1.6mm in diameter, making it easy to introduce it into meats. Keep it in the food for 2-3 seconds, you will get an accurate temperature. It's has a wide temperature range of -58°F~572°F (-50°C~300°C), supports both Celsius (°C) and Fahrenheit (°F) display with accuracy to ±1 degree. Perfect for beef, chicken, fish, pork, turkey, beverages, baking and candy,all kinds of occasions gives you accurate temp reference. 【Temperature Alarm Function】Temperature setting can refer to the instant read thermometer temperature chart and pre-set the temperature. Press the ‘ALARM SET’ button on the food thermometer to set your target temperature. When the temperature reaches the pre-set temperature, the thermometer will flash on the big screen and the alarm will sound. The alarm will last for 10 minutes unless you press any button to stop it. 【IPX7 Waterproof, Backlit Display, Internal Magnet】The food thermometer is made of high-quality waterproof eco-friendly ABS plastic, which means it’s easy to wash it under running water. Simply wash the thermometer probe and body under running water.It also has a large backlight screen, enabling you to see the temp clearly whether in a poorly lighted kitchen or outdoors of too much light. Built-in magnets and hanging holes make it easy to attach to the refrigerator or hang anywhere. 【Abundant Components,Perfect Gift】Digital thermometer with THREE sufficient batteries, 1 most popular meat temperature reference guide, 1 detailed instruction manual, 1 beautiful portable box,1 round key to open the battery cover. Our meat thermometers for cooking and grilling are packaged in an elegant carryable box, making it an ideal gift for any barbecue or cooking enthusiast or professional.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dfN4ZXJvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MRMOSY","source_asin":"B0BFLGN852","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFLGN852","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFLGN852","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
