window.products.push({"id":454752,"name":"4\" Baby Diaper Metal Cookie Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yHxiXZ4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"So Many Uses! Our metal cookie cutters many uses beyond cookies. Lets see... There's: clay, fondant, biscuit cutter, sandwich cutter, pancake mold, egg mold, wax mold, air freshener molds, car freshies, stencils, the possibilities are endless! Friendly and Safe Our metal cookie cutters are made from food safe tin plated steel. Made in USA From start to finish our cookie cutters are proudly made in the USA! Family Fun Cookie cutters make a great way to get kids excited about cooking and enrich celebrations. Care Instructions Hand wash in warm water. Hand dry or place in oven to dry completely. Keep out of dishwashers. As long as the cutters are clean and dried completely they will last forever without rust or tarnishing!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yHxiXZ4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bundle of Fun","source_asin":"B09SZSW9CB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SZSW9CB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SZSW9CB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":454753,"name":"Pittsford Outfitters Classic Water Bottle | Double Wall, Vacuum Insulated, Stainless Steel, Leak Proof, & Powder Coated with BPA Free & Metal Lined In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gR6uCdW0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you’re drinking water or wine, whether you’re hanging by the pool, on the porch, or at the game, whether you’re working, at school, or taking some time off for a not so everyday adventure… Whatever you happen to be doing, the Pittsford Outfitters Classic “Water” bottle makes the perfect drinking companion, one that’s up for any adventure, anywhere, any time. Constructed out of kitchen grade, food safe, & shatterproof 18/8 stainless steel with a stylish classic design, this double walled and vacuum insulated water bottle keeps your cold drinks cold & your hot drinks hot for hours on end, regardless of what’s going on outside the bottle. Odor resistant, it will not rust or leave a metal taste in your mouth, and it doesn’t affect or retain flavors like a traditional water bottle might… And our leak proof cap is insulated and lined with metal to make sure that your drink not only stays hot for up to 12 hours or cold for up to 24, but that it tastes exactly like what you put into it (and not plastic) when you do finally get a chance to enjoy it. Cupholder friendly, the Pittsford Outfitters Classic Water Bottle is coated with an easy grip, durable, & textured matte powder coating that won't sweat (even on the hottest of days), never gets hot to the touch (even with the hottest of drinks), and is designed with the perfectly sized opening: big enough that most ice cubes will fit and you can easily fill it with your beverage of choice, but still small enough that it pours well and is easy to drink from. The Pittsford Outfitters classic water bottle is perfect for every adventure, every day. Available in a variety of colors & sizes, they - like all our products - come with the peace of mind of a 30-day No Hassle Satisfaction Guarantee & a Lifetime Warranty against defects. Pittsford Outfitters – Go outside. Play. Repeat. Includes 1 Classic Bottle with Insulated CapA Pittsford Outfitters Exclusive – Hand Wash Only","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gR6uCdW0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pittsford Outfitters","source_asin":"B0791214N8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0791214N8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0791214N8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
