window.products.push({"id":454793,"name":"Embome Retractable Clothes Rack- Wall Mounted Clothes Rack for Laundry Room Closet Storage Organization- Clothes Drying Rack Wall Mount- Wall Mounted ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31q+Gp6xutL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Brand New Uniquely Designed Retractable Clothes Drying Rack, Plastic, Easy Installation! Embome’s wall mount drying clothes rack is made of superior quality, and is exceptionally convenient to store towels and winter coats or effectively air dry your clothes on laundry day and easily collapse it when the laundry’s done . Storage Convenience: Retractable folding wall hanger is an excellent space-saving rack; it can be mounted to any small corner wherever you need it and can fold it into the wall when not in use. It is ideal for small space, laundry room, bathroom, bedroom, or walk-in closet. You can freely dry your clothes anywhere, very convenient. Sturdy Construction & Modern Look: The crisp look of these wall racks for hanging clothes will add a modern look to your home. Its white finish is stylish and perfect to matching to any decor; making the Embome drying rack clothing wall mounted the perfect addition to your home. All Embome plastic folding wall clothes drying rack has smooth corners for your safety. Best Quality: This is the best wall clothes drying rack because is made of strong and durable plastic and a metal rod for added value yet flexible enough for your safety. Its triangular design makes it stable to provide years of quality use. The EMBOME Wall Mount Clothes Hanger is perfect for your home and makes your everyday life easy. Specifications: Color: White Material: Plastic and metal Item 8.5 x 1.7 x 14.5 inches Shape: Triangular Quick Installation Guide! Step 1: Draw two marks on the wall at which you decide to install the rack. Step 2: Drill holes on each mark with a 6mm impact drill. Step 3: Insert the expansion bolt. Step 4: Mount the bracket using the self-tapping screws. Step 5: Attach the wall mounted laundry drying rack to the bracket. Notice: ☑Please follow the \"Product Installation instructions\" step by step. Click on ADD TO CART to get your retractable drying rack TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31q+Gp6xutL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EMBOME","source_asin":"B08LRHSBR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LRHSBR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LRHSBR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
