window.products.push({"id":454940,"name":"WEN Cordless Electric Leaf Blower, Brushless with 40V Max 2Ah Battery and Charger (40410), Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SCd8WlkAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Remember when you didn’t have to hassle with gasoline or extension cords to do yard work? Leave the gas at the gas station and the cords at the cord store with the WEN 40V 480 CFM Cordless Leaf Blower. With up to 480 CFM of blowing power, you’ll be able to create 124 MPH wind streams that blast away rocks, sticks, leaves, and everything else in your path. Lightweight design weighs in at a mere 7 pounds with battery, limiting user fatigue during operation. The included 40V 2Ah lithium-Ion battery provides consistent power without fading or suffering memory loss from repeated charges. The WEN 40V Blower features three different speeds: normal (92 MPH, 370 CFM), high speed (114 MPH, 450 CFM) and turbo (124 MPH, 480 CFM) to meet the needs of any job. This package also includes a charger with LED indicator lights and a high speed tip attachment for blowing small rocks and sticks. And because it’s a WEN product, your WEN 40V Cordless Leaf Blower comes backed by a nationwide network of skilled service technicians, a friendly customer helpline and a two-year warranty. Remember when your sidewalks were debris free? Remember WEN","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SCd8WlkAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEN","source_asin":"B07Y1G36PW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-454940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y1G36PW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y1G36PW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
